        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Spore Cysts" id="1466-c13e-8906-e37e" hidden="false">
          <description>Each enemy model that moves within 8&quot; of the model is fired at immediately using the models BS, the spore cyst weapon stats and normal shooting modifiers including the -1 hit modifier for overwatch targets coming out of cover if applicable. During the Tyranid shooting phase (not movement phase), the model automatically fires its spore cysts once at each enemy model within 8&quot; that is not in close combat with the model. Dreadnoughts and closed vehicles are always ignored</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
